(4169893, 600132, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and the play of light through the droplets. I might have sharpened it a touch more, but I''m not sure if that would really help or hurt it. Only real nitpick is the composition does not lead me to anything in particular.  A different crop may have pulled me in better. I think it is the large drop in the lower right quarter that is the culprit, when I cover up the right 1/3, it flows better.</td>', 'Nice colors and the play of light through the droplets. I might have sharpened it a touch more, but I''m not sure if that would really help or hurt it. Only real nitpick is the composition does not lead me to anything in particular.  A different crop may have pulled me in better. I think it is the large drop in the lower right quarter that is the culprit, when I cover up the right 1/3, it flows better.', '2007-10-15 18:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4169897, 598826, 83313, '<td valign="top">Technically a good capture, but It seems very static and uninteresting. The dead-center composition is the largest part of that. Shooting the shell at a different angle would have helped as well.</td>', 'Technically a good capture, but It seems very static and uninteresting. The dead-center composition is the largest part of that. Shooting the shell at a different angle would have helped as well.', '2007-10-15 18:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4169902, 599044, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a very different idea. Creative and well done.</td>', 'Nice shot of a very different idea. Creative and well done.', '2007-10-15 18:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4169905, 600165, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love the title. The subject seems crammed over there in the corner.</td>', 'Love the title. The subject seems crammed over there in the corner.', '2007-10-15 18:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4169908, 599452, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost seems like a painting. It''s obvious the flower was enhanced to stand out from the background. Perhaps the background could have used a little enhancement, though not as much as the flower. Composition and subject work well.</td>', 'Almost seems like a painting. It''s obvious the flower was enhanced to stand out from the background. Perhaps the background could have used a little enhancement, though not as much as the flower. Composition and subject work well.', '2007-10-15 18:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4169911, 600021, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and texture, but I am left wondering what plant this is. Composition strikes me as too much dead center. Perhaps cropping it at an angle would give it some more interest.</td>', 'Nice colors and texture, but I am left wondering what plant this is. Composition strikes me as too much dead center. Perhaps cropping it at an angle would give it some more interest.', '2007-10-15 18:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4169913, 600257, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice muted yellows, and I like the asymmetrical shape. Some more detail in the seeds would have really helped it stand out.</td>', 'Nice muted yellows, and I like the asymmetrical shape. Some more detail in the seeds would have really helped it stand out.', '2007-10-15 18:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
