(4172611, 599326, 8860, '<td valign="top">Interesting indeed - very unique (brave) shot so high marks for that courage. Technically imperfect but it doesn''t matter too much sometimes. <br/> <br/>Is it a nellyfant trunk?</td>', 'Interesting indeed - very unique (brave) shot so high marks for that courage. Technically imperfect but it doesn''t matter too much sometimes.  Is it a nellyfant trunk?', '2007-10-16 20:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
