(4172623, 600141, 8860, '<td valign="top">A stunningly clear macro of a gruesome scene. <br/> <br/>It wouldn''t be so bad if this was the wild but it''s not. It''s a man-made death and it''s painful and unpleasant for the victim (unless killed humanely prior to feed which, due to blood looks like it hasn''t been.). You''ll probably get marked down for that compassion factor, but I''ll overlook it because this is a tecchnically well shot photo.<br/> <br/>Incidentally, I''ve kept snakes and pythons for many years and have always weaned them onto humanely killed, frozen food. It''s illegal to feed live now in the UK.</td>', 'A stunningly clear macro of a gruesome scene.  It wouldn''t be so bad if this was the wild but it''s not. It''s a man-made death and it''s painful and unpleasant for the victim (unless killed humanely prior to feed which, due to blood looks like it hasn''t been.). You''ll probably get marked down for that compassion factor, but I''ll overlook it because this is a tecchnically well shot photo. Incidentally, I''ve kept snakes and pythons for many years and have always weaned them onto humanely killed, frozen food. It''s illegal to feed live now in the UK.', '2007-10-16 20:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4172646, 599510, 84736, '<td valign="top">This shot is great. Period.</td>', 'This shot is great. Period.', '2007-10-16 20:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
