(4177037, 600022, 23002, '<td valign="top">great perspective on a fountain pen. :)  nicely executed, great exposure and focus, the drop of water with....a lion in it?  ok.  with the lion it gets a 10 and a fav.  I hope others see it too. good luck.</td>', 'great perspective on a fountain pen. :)  nicely executed, great exposure and focus, the drop of water with....a lion in it?  ok.  with the lion it gets a 10 and a fav.  I hope others see it too. good luck.', '2007-10-17 23:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
