(4177044, 599510, 23002, '<td valign="top">wow.  potential front page here!  great colours, amazing focus, nice background, perfect exposure... should do well.  be proud of it and good luck.  oh and a fav too.</td>', 'wow.  potential front page here!  great colours, amazing focus, nice background, perfect exposure... should do well.  be proud of it and good luck.  oh and a fav too.', '2007-10-17 23:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
