(4182486, 600345, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love dew of friut like this - nice eye.   However, the image does not seem very balanced, as if the berries are going to fall over.  A recrop to close in more on the berries and take out the far right branch would help focus the image more</td>', 'i love dew of friut like this - nice eye.   However, the image does not seem very balanced, as if the berries are going to fall over.  A recrop to close in more on the berries and take out the far right branch would help focus the image more', '2007-10-20 07:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4182487, 600188, 67152, '<td valign="top">very cool focus on the eye.  The thing that seems to bother me a bit is the strange blue cast to the image - playing with hue/saturation and color balance might help.</td>', 'very cool focus on the eye.  The thing that seems to bother me a bit is the strange blue cast to the image - playing with hue/saturation and color balance might help.', '2007-10-20 07:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4182488, 598160, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice use of centered composition.  i think it is a bit oversharpened, however</td>', 'nice use of centered composition.  i think it is a bit oversharpened, however', '2007-10-20 07:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4182489, 599344, 67152, '<td valign="top">the placement of the salt shaker is pretty good - but the image is not very sharp in focus and the background really doesn''t add very much</td>', 'the placement of the salt shaker is pretty good - but the image is not very sharp in focus and the background really doesn''t add very much', '2007-10-20 07:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4182490, 599451, 67152, '<td valign="top">very good control of focus and exposure - excellent macro</td>', 'very good control of focus and exposure - excellent macro', '2007-10-20 07:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
