(4183039, 599619, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail.  The green parts look very juicy, almost alien, and the pinkish parts look almost transparent.  Good colour combination.  ~8</td>', 'Beautiful detail.  The green parts look very juicy, almost alien, and the pinkish parts look almost transparent.  Good colour combination.  ~8', '2007-10-20 13:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
