(4183057, 599610, 5112, '<td valign="top">Quite a beautiful closeup of this little bee.  The image looks a little grainy, sort of like maybe you cropped in a lot?  It also seems to lack contrast a bit.  I like the placement of the bee/flower at the bottom right, however, IMHO there''s a bit too much negative space.</td>', 'Quite a beautiful closeup of this little bee.  The image looks a little grainy, sort of like maybe you cropped in a lot?  It also seems to lack contrast a bit.  I like the placement of the bee/flower at the bottom right, however, IMHO there''s a bit too much negative space.', '2007-10-20 14:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183062, 600141, 5112, '<td valign="top">Is this real, or is it a display of some sort?  If real, wow, what a catch!  If a display, well, still a neat picture :)</td>', 'Is this real, or is it a display of some sort?  If real, wow, what a catch!  If a display, well, still a neat picture :)', '2007-10-20 14:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183069, 597164, 5112, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this a 4, in part because I don''t think it''s a very good picture technically: it''s centred, looks blurry, and the pp looks a bit goofy.  It does meet the challenge however.  The title is silly.  You''d do better without it :)</td>', 'I''m giving this a 4, in part because I don''t think it''s a very good picture technically: it''s centred, looks blurry, and the pp looks a bit goofy.  It does meet the challenge however.  The title is silly.  You''d do better without it :)', '2007-10-20 14:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183074, 600318, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very interesting how the front part of the insect''s "face" looks like orange peel.  Good image.  ~8</td>', 'Very interesting how the front part of the insect''s "face" looks like orange peel.  Good image.  ~8', '2007-10-20 14:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183079, 597985, 5112, '<td valign="top">Love this!  Gentle colours, good detail, evocative imaging.  So far, one of my favourites.  ~10</td>', 'Love this!  Gentle colours, good detail, evocative imaging.  So far, one of my favourites.  ~10', '2007-10-20 14:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183098, 600202, 5112, '<td valign="top">Broken windshield (or something like that).  Good concept.  I think the image would have benefited from a bit brighter light and a bit deeper focus - the leaf looks in focus, but the broken glass is only in part (the angle doesn''t help).  I would be interested in seeing the image in colour also, rather than partially desaturated (it looks partially desaturated now).</td>', 'Broken windshield (or something like that).  Good concept.  I think the image would have benefited from a bit brighter light and a bit deeper focus - the leaf looks in focus, but the broken glass is only in part (the angle doesn''t help).  I would be interested in seeing the image in colour also, rather than partially desaturated (it looks partially desaturated now).', '2007-10-20 14:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183103, 599259, 5112, '<td valign="top">Such a dramatic title for such a gentle image :)</td>', 'Such a dramatic title for such a gentle image :)', '2007-10-20 14:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183112, 597542, 5112, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  If this is real, it''s a good catch.  The background colours work really well here.  I wish the top antenna were not cut off.  ~8</td>', 'Yikes!  If this is real, it''s a good catch.  The background colours work really well here.  I wish the top antenna were not cut off.  ~8', '2007-10-20 14:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183118, 598904, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea, good detail, the "expression" is good.  The image lacks punch though, even a slight curves adjustment would it it a bit more punch.</td>', 'Beautiful idea, good detail, the "expression" is good.  The image lacks punch though, even a slight curves adjustment would it it a bit more punch.', '2007-10-20 14:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183123, 600137, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is either a picture of something printed, or the processing makes it look like it is something printed, flat in other words.  If it is a picture of a print, well, what can I say.  If its the processing, well, my personal opinion is that it''s not doing the subject justice.  As a composition, it''s difficult to figure out what to look at, it''s a neat pattern overall, but what is the subject, what is it that you''re showing here?  ~5</td>', 'This is either a picture of something printed, or the processing makes it look like it is something printed, flat in other words.  If it is a picture of a print, well, what can I say.  If its the processing, well, my personal opinion is that it''s not doing the subject justice.  As a composition, it''s difficult to figure out what to look at, it''s a neat pattern overall, but what is the subject, what is it that you''re showing here?  ~5', '2007-10-20 14:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183158, 599967, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  If it were me, I''d likely worked on making the droplets/seed hairs  a little brighter and punchier (select highlights, curve up a little bit, USM on highlights only, possibly a very slight warming filter again only on highlights), I''d cropped a little off the top (a bit too much negative space), and I''d tried to de-emphasize the fairly clear stems at the bottom left.  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful!  If it were me, I''d likely worked on making the droplets/seed hairs  a little brighter and punchier (select highlights, curve up a little bit, USM on highlights only, possibly a very slight warming filter again only on highlights), I''d cropped a little off the top (a bit too much negative space), and I''d tried to de-emphasize the fairly clear stems at the bottom left.  ~9', '2007-10-20 14:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183161, 600321, 5112, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite look like Sherpet''s work, but it does look like her subject matter.  I like the light green outlines of the leaves.</td>', 'Doesn''t quite look like Sherpet''s work, but it does look like her subject matter.  I like the light green outlines of the leaves.', '2007-10-20 14:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
