(4185293, 599778, 67258, '<td valign="top">These insects never fail to fascinate me - it must be so bizarre coming across one!  This photo is really well framed, and I particular the diagonals formed by the antennae. legs and head.</td>', 'These insects never fail to fascinate me - it must be so bizarre coming across one!  This photo is really well framed, and I particular the diagonals formed by the antennae. legs and head.', '2007-10-21 16:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4185297, 600184, 67258, '<td valign="top">In England the insect that we call a Daddy Longlegs is a type of crane fly - always takes me aback when different nations use the same words for different things!  This is a super composition of an unusual insect (certainly one I have never seen before); the blue background acts as a good foil for the main subject, particularly with the interesting lighting on its legs and on the top of the seed head.  It is a shame that you haven''t been able to reflect a bit more light on to the subject, as it is a little dark on my monitor (admitedly uncalibrated).<br/>Back to bump to 8.</td>', 'In England the insect that we call a Daddy Longlegs is a type of crane fly - always takes me aback when different nations use the same words for different things!  This is a super composition of an unusual insect (certainly one I have never seen before); the blue background acts as a good foil for the main subject, particularly with the interesting lighting on its legs and on the top of the seed head.  It is a shame that you haven''t been able to reflect a bit more light on to the subject, as it is a little dark on my monitor (admitedly uncalibrated).Back to bump to 8.', '2007-10-21 16:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4185310, 599944, 8860, '<td valign="top">Pretty DOF and lovely clarity. Like the compsotion too. Bee is a little indistinct near the head (due to shadow) which is a shame.</td>', 'Pretty DOF and lovely clarity. Like the compsotion too. Bee is a little indistinct near the head (due to shadow) which is a shame.', '2007-10-21 16:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
