(4186220, 599341, 60862, '<td valign="top">A beautiful contrast between small and large, curves and lines, smoothness and granularity.</td>', 'A beautiful contrast between small and large, curves and lines, smoothness and granularity.', '2007-10-22 00:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186225, 600075, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the wild colors, but I think I would like the composition better off-center.  I find centered works best when cropped tight.</td>', 'I like the wild colors, but I think I would like the composition better off-center.  I find centered works best when cropped tight.', '2007-10-22 00:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186233, 600323, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not seeing either magnification or even a closeup here.</td>', 'Not seeing either magnification or even a closeup here.', '2007-10-22 00:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186237, 599912, 60862, '<td valign="top">Those white loops still look like the tops of water droplets to me, Deb. :)  I''m not voting on it, of course, but I hope you''ve gotten some fun out of it!</td>', 'Those white loops still look like the tops of water droplets to me, Deb. :)  I''m not voting on it, of course, but I hope you''ve gotten some fun out of it!', '2007-10-22 00:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186239, 600257, 60862, '<td valign="top">Still think this is cool, Steve.  I really like the color instead of the typical bright green for a kiwi.  I''m not voting as a team member, of course, but I hope people are enjoying it as much as we did!</td>', 'Still think this is cool, Steve.  I really like the color instead of the typical bright green for a kiwi.  I''m not voting as a team member, of course, but I hope people are enjoying it as much as we did!', '2007-10-22 00:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186245, 599326, 60862, '<td valign="top">Heh - the end of an elephant''s trunk?</td>', 'Heh - the end of an elephant''s trunk?', '2007-10-22 00:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186250, 600141, 60862, '<td valign="top">I bet some people are going to complain about this being gross, but I think it''s fascinating.  We don''t get this kind of closeup view of nature''s grim reality very often.  The mouse''s bulging eyeball is an interesting detail mirroring the bubble and the snake''s bulbous eye.  To me, macro photography is all about showing us details we don''t see at normal scale, so this is a 10 from me.</td>', 'I bet some people are going to complain about this being gross, but I think it''s fascinating.  We don''t get this kind of closeup view of nature''s grim reality very often.  The mouse''s bulging eyeball is an interesting detail mirroring the bubble and the snake''s bulbous eye.  To me, macro photography is all about showing us details we don''t see at normal scale, so this is a 10 from me.', '2007-10-22 00:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186251, 598830, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shapes, detail, color, and clarity.</td>', 'Wonderful shapes, detail, color, and clarity.', '2007-10-22 00:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186253, 597542, 60862, '<td valign="top">Incredible timing and fantastic clarity and detail.  Congrats!</td>', 'Incredible timing and fantastic clarity and detail.  Congrats!', '2007-10-22 00:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186254, 600119, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Not only beautiful and colorful, but the detail is stunning.  I mean, seeing a water drop on a fly''s eye?  Amazing.  Congrats on your ribbon in advance!</td>', 'Wow.  Not only beautiful and colorful, but the detail is stunning.  I mean, seeing a water drop on a fly''s eye?  Amazing.  Congrats on your ribbon in advance!', '2007-10-22 00:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186256, 599195, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!  I really like how the brightness and color of the drop stand out.</td>', 'Nice catch!  I really like how the brightness and color of the drop stand out.', '2007-10-22 00:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186257, 599601, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very pretty abstract. :)</td>', 'Very pretty abstract. :)', '2007-10-22 00:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
