(4186271, 600373, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a beautiful deja vu entry, your first ribbon, and your new personal best!  Just wonderfully executed.</td>', 'Congrats on a beautiful deja vu entry, your first ribbon, and your new personal best!  Just wonderfully executed.', '2007-10-22 01:04:29.000000', NULL, 0),
