(4186273, 600119, 60862, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''S how to do a macro.  I just knew it when I hit it in voting that this was going to do well.  What a score!  Congrats on your first ribbon and new personal best. :)</td>', 'Now THAT''S how to do a macro.  I just knew it when I hit it in voting that this was going to do well.  What a score!  Congrats on your first ribbon and new personal best. :)', '2007-10-22 01:05:50.000000', NULL, 0),
