(4186280, 597542, 60862, '<td valign="top">Well, no great surprise here, Jason - you are the macro master.  This was a really interesting take on the challenge, so congrats again!</td>', 'Well, no great surprise here, Jason - you are the macro master.  This was a really interesting take on the challenge, so congrats again!', '2007-10-22 01:08:10.000000', NULL, 0);
