(4186320, 600100, 67697, '<td valign="top">Poor flower - what did it do to deserve this?  <br/> <br/>lol actually it''s a pretty cool (or hot) idea and i love how you captured the flame.  The flame has a beautiful red glow.  I am surprised this did not do better!</td>', 'Poor flower - what did it do to deserve this?   lol actually it''s a pretty cool (or hot) idea and i love how you captured the flame.  The flame has a beautiful red glow.  I am surprised this did not do better!', '2007-10-22 01:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4186323, 600129, 60862, '<td valign="top">Clever title, Shannon!  Very good composition and color, too.</td>', 'Clever title, Shannon!  Very good composition and color, too.', '2007-10-22 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
