(4186326, 600216, 28359, '<td valign="top">Last minute shot. Sold my 100mm macro a while ago. Didn''t realize until I started processing. White mushrooms and a black subject. Little color adjustment, the rest was dodge mostly burning.</td>', 'Last minute shot. Sold my 100mm macro a while ago. Didn''t realize until I started processing. White mushrooms and a black subject. Little color adjustment, the rest was dodge mostly burning.', '2007-10-22 01:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4186334, 600333, 67697, '<td valign="top">I agree about the noise but I do love your background color against the salt.  Well you can laugh at all the low voters when they are out slipping on the ice and you are out tossing the salt hehe.</td>', 'I agree about the noise but I do love your background color against the salt.  Well you can laugh at all the low voters when they are out slipping on the ice and you are out tossing the salt hehe.', '2007-10-22 01:18:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4186339, 597542, 25355, '<td valign="top">Well, stunning photo. Congratulations.<br/>What are the odds of finding a mantis during macro week? I found two on the same hedge, and didn''t have to try the ol'' dragonfly shoot. ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-22 00:20:00.</i></td>', 'Well, stunning photo. Congratulations.What are the odds of finding a mantis during macro week? I found two on the same hedge, and didn''t have to try the ol'' dragonfly shoot. ;-)', '2007-10-22 01:18:54.000000', '2007-10-22 01:20:00.000000', 0),
(4186340, 600119, 52500, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  Congrats on your first ribbon and insane score!  A most deserving win.</td>', 'Fantastic!  Congrats on your first ribbon and insane score!  A most deserving win.', '2007-10-22 01:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
