(4186814, 600236, 34041, '<td valign="top">Wow - sorry to see this so low. I was one of your 10''s - the only one I gave out in this challenge.  I think you must have been hammered because the DNMC zealots thought this was not macro enough.  Maybe they thought it was a real street?  With a giant sea creature?  It sure seems macro enough to me. A macro does not mean that you need to see the pores on its face  just needs to be a close-up, and this certainly is. <br/> <br/>Too bad, this should have been on the front page  very creative.<br/></td>', 'Wow - sorry to see this so low. I was one of your 10''s - the only one I gave out in this challenge.  I think you must have been hammered because the DNMC zealots thought this was not macro enough.  Maybe they thought it was a real street?  With a giant sea creature?  It sure seems macro enough to me. A macro does not mean that you need to see the pores on its face  just needs to be a close-up, and this certainly is.  Too bad, this should have been on the front page  very creative.', '2007-10-22 08:21:53.000000', NULL, 0),
