(4186986, 599783, 61818, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot though I didn''t vote.  Reminded me of something from a NIN or Tool video.  Can''t figure out why it scored sub-6, though every time I look at it I get this feeling that the image is tilted slightly.  Maybe that''s it.</td>', 'I really liked this shot though I didn''t vote.  Reminded me of something from a NIN or Tool video.  Can''t figure out why it scored sub-6, though every time I look at it I get this feeling that the image is tilted slightly.  Maybe that''s it.', '2007-10-22 10:27:09.000000', NULL, 0),
