(4187038, 599250, 60862, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo!  ANOTHER personal best! Three challenges, three personal bests.  Now that''s what I call growth. :)  FWIW, I gave this an 8 - I thought it really captured what macro photography is all about: showing us details we wouldn''t normally see.  And you did it in a nice composition with beautiful shallow DOF.  I especially like how the water''s surface tension is just barely holding back the flood.  It tells a story of life lost and on the verge of being swept from memory entirely.</td>', 'Woo hoo!  ANOTHER personal best! Three challenges, three personal bests.  Now that''s what I call growth. :)  FWIW, I gave this an 8 - I thought it really captured what macro photography is all about: showing us details we wouldn''t normally see.  And you did it in a nice composition with beautiful shallow DOF.  I especially like how the water''s surface tension is just barely holding back the flood.  It tells a story of life lost and on the verge of being swept from memory entirely.', '2007-10-22 11:02:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187060, 600101, 79720, '<td valign="top">I''m a little surprised, given the quality of some of the other images in your portfolio.</td>', 'I''m a little surprised, given the quality of some of the other images in your portfolio.', '2007-10-22 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187068, 599586, 40973, '<td valign="top">Cool - nice textures and light. I had no idea this was a mushroom. It looked upside down like a wooden bucket with a pole like a butter churner? or an exotic pineapple drink.</td>', 'Cool - nice textures and light. I had no idea this was a mushroom. It looked upside down like a wooden bucket with a pole like a butter churner? or an exotic pineapple drink.', '2007-10-22 11:15:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187075, 600344, 40973, '<td valign="top">This was so lovely I thought this was a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50641" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">skewsme</a> creation. Tricky.</td>', 'This was so lovely I thought this was a  skewsme creation. Tricky.', '2007-10-22 11:18:27.000000', NULL, 0),
