(4187230, 600304, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hi Kelli.  I voted 6 on this.  I like the composition, and there''s a reasonable amount of detail in the feathers.<br/> <br/>However, to really crank up the score, you need amazing detail.  Compare the sharpness of this to the top scorers.  I''m not talking sharp for the sake of being sharp, but how it adds detail.<br/> <br/>This may be a case where your camera''s lens is limiting you.<br/> <br/>It''s also pretty noisy.  That didn''t bother me too much, but some people will drop you hard for it.  Looking at the beak, actually, do you see the little specks?  That''s either noise or what''s left over sometimes from too much sharpening after noise reduction.<br/> <br/>Finally, the eyes look dead because there''s no light, no iris, and no catchlights.</td>', 'Hi Kelli.  I voted 6 on this.  I like the composition, and there''s a reasonable amount of detail in the feathers. However, to really crank up the score, you need amazing detail.  Compare the sharpness of this to the top scorers.  I''m not talking sharp for the sake of being sharp, but how it adds detail. This may be a case where your camera''s lens is limiting you. It''s also pretty noisy.  That didn''t bother me too much, but some people will drop you hard for it.  Looking at the beak, actually, do you see the little specks?  That''s either noise or what''s left over sometimes from too much sharpening after noise reduction. Finally, the eyes look dead because there''s no light, no iris, and no catchlights.', '2007-10-22 12:34:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187233, 600099, 554, '<td valign="top">This should have placed much higher than it did.  Too many ppl didnt know what it is.....nice shot.  Circulated pennies aren''t pristine.</td>', 'This should have placed much higher than it did.  Too many ppl didnt know what it is.....nice shot.  Circulated pennies aren''t pristine.', '2007-10-22 12:36:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187237, 600373, 58728, '<td valign="top">YEAH NATHAN!!!  Congrats!!!  This is a beautiful image.  Rock OUT!</td>', 'YEAH NATHAN!!!  Congrats!!!  This is a beautiful image.  Rock OUT!', '2007-10-22 12:38:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187238, 600304, 43148, '<td valign="top">Give it a shot for you, first thing I notice when looking at pic is the two pronounced white spots above and below the left eye, seem to draw my attention immediatly and distract from the photo, personal opinion is it would have done a bit better with a profile rather than a head on shot. I did not vote but would probably have scored this a six, a little above average photo. As always, these are my opinions, and they are worth probably what you paid for them! LOL<br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'Give it a shot for you, first thing I notice when looking at pic is the two pronounced white spots above and below the left eye, seem to draw my attention immediatly and distract from the photo, personal opinion is it would have done a bit better with a profile rather than a head on shot. I did not vote but would probably have scored this a six, a little above average photo. As always, these are my opinions, and they are worth probably what you paid for them! LOL Jacque', '2007-10-22 12:39:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187266, 600132, 65319, '<td valign="top">Delicate and beautiful...a lovely entry!</td>', 'Delicate and beautiful...a lovely entry!', '2007-10-22 12:59:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187267, 599611, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very cool for a macro shot. I haven''t seen a flame capture quite like this one. Love the detail in the metal? Has a nice gritty feel to it.</td>', 'Very cool for a macro shot. I haven''t seen a flame capture quite like this one. Love the detail in the metal? Has a nice gritty feel to it.', '2007-10-22 12:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187272, 600304, 65858, '<td valign="top">I agree - in the context of this challenge, this looks like an oversharpened crop rather than a full-frame close-up.  And the difference in the details/noise.<br/> <br/>From an aesthetic/wow perspective, this just doesn''t strike me as something of great interest.  I didn''t vote on this, but probably would have voted 5 as well.  Maybe it''s the lack of color variation, maybe it''s the odd tilt, I can''t really put my finger on it.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps!<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>-Jeff</td>', 'I agree - in the context of this challenge, this looks like an oversharpened crop rather than a full-frame close-up.  And the difference in the details/noise. From an aesthetic/wow perspective, this just doesn''t strike me as something of great interest.  I didn''t vote on this, but probably would have voted 5 as well.  Maybe it''s the lack of color variation, maybe it''s the odd tilt, I can''t really put my finger on it. Hope this helps! Cheers,-Jeff', '2007-10-22 13:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187276, 600304, 34763, '<td valign="top">Hi Kelli,<br/>I believe that part of the average score is the crop, the noise and the jpg artifacts due to either over sharpening or cropping a small picture and enlarging it too much. With the crop normally here at DPC voters are overly concerned if you don''t try to follow the rules of thirds. I don''t necessarily agree that thirds is alway the right answer but DPC''rs think so. Several areas on the bird inclusing the feathers and also areas outside the bird shows a lot of smooth noise. The individual feathers have significant artifacts or jaggies. This could be because of over sharpening or cropping in very close. I also have had some very poor scores that make me scratch my head. Don''t let them get under your skin, if you like it then thats what is important. Best of Luck</td>', 'Hi Kelli,I believe that part of the average score is the crop, the noise and the jpg artifacts due to either over sharpening or cropping a small picture and enlarging it too much. With the crop normally here at DPC voters are overly concerned if you don''t try to follow the rules of thirds. I don''t necessarily agree that thirds is alway the right answer but DPC''rs think so. Several areas on the bird inclusing the feathers and also areas outside the bird shows a lot of smooth noise. The individual feathers have significant artifacts or jaggies. This could be because of over sharpening or cropping in very close. I also have had some very poor scores that make me scratch my head. Don''t let them get under your skin, if you like it then thats what is important. Best of Luck', '2007-10-22 13:02:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187290, 600359, 65319, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail...underrated in the score...a terrific shot, Steve!</td>', 'Incredible detail...underrated in the score...a terrific shot, Steve!', '2007-10-22 13:07:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187292, 600373, 66348, '<td valign="top">Loved his shot, loved yours. Congrats on the Ribb!!</td>', 'Loved his shot, loved yours. Congrats on the Ribb!!', '2007-10-22 13:10:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187293, 600318, 29949, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Nice score Tony!!<br/>Great shot!</td>', 'Congrats! Nice score Tony!!Great shot!', '2007-10-22 13:10:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187310, 598083, 66494, '<td valign="top">Bear, I thought at the time this should get top spot. AND I still think it. Congrats on a nice finish.</td>', 'Bear, I thought at the time this should get top spot. AND I still think it. Congrats on a nice finish.', '2007-10-22 13:17:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187317, 599250, 66494, '<td valign="top">Patio Babe, HUGE CONGRATS. This gal is expanding ... where''s the floral for the macro. Glad it did well. 40, woooohooooo and a 6.2, AND a brand new personal best. Good going.</td>', 'Patio Babe, HUGE CONGRATS. This gal is expanding ... where''s the floral for the macro. Glad it did well. 40, woooohooooo and a 6.2, AND a brand new personal best. Good going.', '2007-10-22 13:21:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187321, 600009, 66348, '<td valign="top">Welcome back!!!!! Love to see you putting in work. I really like this lil guy. He looks like a bug out of a Disney movie. Nice job.</td>', 'Welcome back!!!!! Love to see you putting in work. I really like this lil guy. He looks like a bug out of a Disney movie. Nice job.', '2007-10-22 13:24:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187358, 600304, 12998, '<td valign="top">Most of the comments left cover how I felt.  There seems to be a shadow vertical across the body which is distracting.  The background is also distracting.  Next time, try to get the eye in focus, if he had turned his head a little more, it might have helped the score.</td>', 'Most of the comments left cover how I felt.  There seems to be a shadow vertical across the body which is distracting.  The background is also distracting.  Next time, try to get the eye in focus, if he had turned his head a little more, it might have helped the score.', '2007-10-22 13:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187365, 599250, 51597, '<td valign="top">WAY TO GO!!!  Can''t believe i missed this one.. Slap me!! <br/></td>', 'WAY TO GO!!!  Can''t believe i missed this one.. Slap me!! ', '2007-10-22 14:01:29.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4187368, 600371, 51597, '<td valign="top">Holy Cow!! Somehow missed this whole challenge.. <br/>CONGRATS!!  EXtremely nice Macro..</td>', 'Holy Cow!! Somehow missed this whole challenge.. CONGRATS!!  EXtremely nice Macro..', '2007-10-22 14:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187384, 599369, 58610, '<td valign="top">Hey Roz, congrats on this wonderful top 10. Love this shot.</td>', 'Hey Roz, congrats on this wonderful top 10. Love this shot.', '2007-10-22 14:13:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187387, 599912, 62318, '<td valign="top">This is cool. I love macros like this. Nice highlights and wonderful details. I''m a bit surprised it did not score at least a six.</td>', 'This is cool. I love macros like this. Nice highlights and wonderful details. I''m a bit surprised it did not score at least a six.', '2007-10-22 14:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187390, 599620, 62318, '<td valign="top">It does look really cool! That is some very nice detail you have. Feels industrial. I''m guessing the low votes were due to the pano format. I guess. I haven''t the foggiest why this would score below a 5.</td>', 'It does look really cool! That is some very nice detail you have. Feels industrial. I''m guessing the low votes were due to the pano format. I guess. I haven''t the foggiest why this would score below a 5.', '2007-10-22 14:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187391, 600304, 50695, '<td valign="top">yeah, I was one of your many 5s.... Personally I like the "noise" and the "softness". It looks like a drawing/painting. What I didn''t like was the static composition, the big head taking up most of the frame in perfect centerhood. I realize that the challenge pushed you in that direction, so I understand your choice. That''s probably why I voted the whole challenge so low. Very few macros appeal to me. Most of them seem to be saying "look at how cool my lens is!" At least you didn''t have that problem. ;)</td>', 'yeah, I was one of your many 5s.... Personally I like the "noise" and the "softness". It looks like a drawing/painting. What I didn''t like was the static composition, the big head taking up most of the frame in perfect centerhood. I realize that the challenge pushed you in that direction, so I understand your choice. That''s probably why I voted the whole challenge so low. Very few macros appeal to me. Most of them seem to be saying "look at how cool my lens is!" At least you didn''t have that problem. ;)', '2007-10-22 14:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187392, 599250, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful water flow combined with the very nice textured leaf. Composition is outstanding. Congrats on the well deserved score.</td>', 'Very beautiful water flow combined with the very nice textured leaf. Composition is outstanding. Congrats on the well deserved score.', '2007-10-22 14:17:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187393, 600132, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice finish, Jeffrey! And look at those 6 faves! Congratulations!</td>', 'Nice finish, Jeffrey! And look at those 6 faves! Congratulations!', '2007-10-22 14:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187395, 597542, 50231, '<td valign="top">Amazing Shot Doc! Grats on the yellow!</td>', 'Amazing Shot Doc! Grats on the yellow!', '2007-10-22 14:20:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187401, 600373, 63360, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  So glad to see you at the top.</td>', 'Wonderful!  So glad to see you at the top.', '2007-10-22 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187403, 600132, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very original idea. The soft pastel colors work in concert with the round shapes. Terrific placement of items. Congrats on the wonderful score.</td>', 'Very original idea. The soft pastel colors work in concert with the round shapes. Terrific placement of items. Congrats on the wonderful score.', '2007-10-22 14:26:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187405, 600337, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very very striking. The two tone colors are terrific. The way the needles match the mushroom in color gives a nice fullness to the shot. The competing textures also give a ton of interest. On the basis of those qualities alone this should have been a six type shot. I am sure the focus mongers out there voted you down a bit which is a shame.</td>', 'Very very striking. The two tone colors are terrific. The way the needles match the mushroom in color gives a nice fullness to the shot. The competing textures also give a ton of interest. On the basis of those qualities alone this should have been a six type shot. I am sure the focus mongers out there voted you down a bit which is a shame.', '2007-10-22 14:28:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187408, 600308, 67152, '<td valign="top">I quite liked this image and gave it a 7 during voting.  I thought the glow created by the leaves really worked well.  Yes, it is not a prototypical macro (especially for DPC) but it is really well composed - especially as the background dark areas frame the leaves so nicely.</td>', 'I quite liked this image and gave it a 7 during voting.  I thought the glow created by the leaves really worked well.  Yes, it is not a prototypical macro (especially for DPC) but it is really well composed - especially as the background dark areas frame the leaves so nicely.', '2007-10-22 14:30:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187411, 599673, 62318, '<td valign="top">The neat part of this shot is the wonderfully posture of the bug. It has a very anthropomorphic feel.</td>', 'The neat part of this shot is the wonderfully posture of the bug. It has a very anthropomorphic feel.', '2007-10-22 14:33:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187422, 600337, 64568, '<td valign="top">great colours, should have scored higher IMO ;-)</td>', 'great colours, should have scored higher IMO ;-)', '2007-10-22 14:39:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187423, 600344, 62318, '<td valign="top">I guess I understand why you call it your "sexy lens", the hairy balls are a good subject model. <br/> <br/>Sounds like a lot of work in the post processing, you lost me after the B&amp;W conversion part. Still, it appears to be worth it. Very nice composition and rich colors.</td>', 'I guess I understand why you call it your "sexy lens", the hairy balls are a good subject model.  Sounds like a lot of work in the post processing, you lost me after the B&W conversion part. Still, it appears to be worth it. Very nice composition and rich colors.', '2007-10-22 14:39:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187494, 599611, 52992, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Fetor:</b></div><hr/><i> i know that candle, those are the off candles, i have one in my office to keep the skeeters away. "out door use only" ya right </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nope, not an OFF candle.<br/> <br/>It''s a Glade scented oil candle, "blushing berry"</td>', 'Originally posted by Fetor: i know that candle, those are the off candles, i have one in my office to keep the skeeters away. "out door use only" ya right   Nope, not an OFF candle. It''s a Glade scented oil candle, "blushing berry"', '2007-10-22 15:09:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187507, 600313, 68586, '<td valign="top">Goodness me Shez, what are you doing all the way down in 207 ? <br/> <br/>Lovely colours here with the green and purple but it does look a little soft - not sure if that is deliberate or not, but I guess people expect macro to be really crisp. Always nice to see your plant shot''s though  :-  )<br/></td>', 'Goodness me Shez, what are you doing all the way down in 207 ?  Lovely colours here with the green and purple but it does look a little soft - not sure if that is deliberate or not, but I guess people expect macro to be really crisp. Always nice to see your plant shot''s though  :-  )', '2007-10-22 15:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187524, 600199, 53316, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!! Amazing colors. I love the composition as well.  This is just fantastic.</td>', 'WOW!!!! Amazing colors. I love the composition as well.  This is just fantastic.', '2007-10-22 15:21:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187540, 599250, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great mix of textures.<br/> <br/>Lovely shot and congrats on a new PB.<br/> <br/>Edit to add - 2 more shots and you have a top line above 6 !<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-22 14:27:06.</i></td>', 'Great mix of textures. Lovely shot and congrats on a new PB. Edit to add - 2 more shots and you have a top line above 6 !', '2007-10-22 15:26:18.000000', '2007-10-22 15:27:06.000000', 0),
(4187779, 599128, 50804, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  This was my 35mm f/2 lens reversed on the camera and I had it at f/22 but this was the most DOF I could achieve.  I tried to focus on the cogs nearest the center because they had the best color, and I thought it helped show just how many layers were going on inside that thin little watch.  I knew it would get marks off for lacking focus/sharpness at the front and back but it was my first attempt at macro so I was happy with it.<br/> <br/>At first I entered a close-up of the watch face, but someone''s comment on this shot in my portfolio made me switch them to see how it would do.  I entered the other shot in my local photography challenge and it got an HM.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  This was my 35mm f/2 lens reversed on the camera and I had it at f/22 but this was the most DOF I could achieve.  I tried to focus on the cogs nearest the center because they had the best color, and I thought it helped show just how many layers were going on inside that thin little watch.  I knew it would get marks off for lacking focus/sharpness at the front and back but it was my first attempt at macro so I was happy with it. At first I entered a close-up of the watch face, but someone''s comment on this shot in my portfolio made me switch them to see how it would do.  I entered the other shot in my local photography challenge and it got an HM.', '2007-10-22 16:43:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187936, 600103, 61818, '<td valign="top">You are quite the apt score predictor!<br/> <br/>Very nice detail in the little sliver of the image that is in focus.  one of the big challenges with macro photography is using an aperture that gets as much of your subject in focus as you want/need to make for an interesting photo.  That usually means going with a very narrow aperture, which in turn requires buckets and buckets of light so that you can properly expose the shot.<br/> <br/>Not a lot going on in this shot, but were more of it in focus and if it were shot from a different angle, it might have been a bit more interesting.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'You are quite the apt score predictor! Very nice detail in the little sliver of the image that is in focus.  one of the big challenges with macro photography is using an aperture that gets as much of your subject in focus as you want/need to make for an interesting photo.  That usually means going with a very narrow aperture, which in turn requires buckets and buckets of light so that you can properly expose the shot. Not a lot going on in this shot, but were more of it in focus and if it were shot from a different angle, it might have been a bit more interesting. Good luck.', '2007-10-22 17:49:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187944, 600103, 20530, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you didn''t get ANY comments! Shame on us.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I''d probably have given it a 5 or 6.<br/> <br/>The rich tones and sharpness are nice, but I find myself longing for more to look at. Does that make sense? The extremely shallow DOF leads the eye to a spot, but there isn''t a whole lot to see there. Where''s <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=15711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jutilda</a>when you need her? She always says these things so much better.<br/> <br/>I also think the composition might be more interesting if it were somehow less symmetrical and straight-on. I''m sure you wanted to break away from the same-old rule of thirds thing, but in this case I feel it might have helped.<br/> <br/>Overall, a fine image and surely deserving of some comments.</td>', 'I can''t believe you didn''t get ANY comments! Shame on us. I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I''d probably have given it a 5 or 6. The rich tones and sharpness are nice, but I find myself longing for more to look at. Does that make sense? The extremely shallow DOF leads the eye to a spot, but there isn''t a whole lot to see there. Where''s  jutildawhen you need her? She always says these things so much better. I also think the composition might be more interesting if it were somehow less symmetrical and straight-on. I''m sure you wanted to break away from the same-old rule of thirds thing, but in this case I feel it might have helped. Overall, a fine image and surely deserving of some comments.', '2007-10-22 17:52:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187955, 599356, 66353, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a great score and a top 10 - and a new PB of course.<br/>Beautiful shot :)</td>', 'Congratulations on a great score and a top 10 - and a new PB of course.Beautiful shot :)', '2007-10-22 18:00:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187978, 600219, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey ron .. brilliant photograph .. a wonderful close up image .. that intense blue is amazing .. i do find him fascinating .. i really like macros and insects .. they are the most interesting creatures and this is an excellent example .. :)...</td>', 'hey ron .. brilliant photograph .. a wonderful close up image .. that intense blue is amazing .. i do find him fascinating .. i really like macros and insects .. they are the most interesting creatures and this is an excellent example .. :)...', '2007-10-22 18:06:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187981, 600103, 28742, '<td valign="top">no comment. :P j/k<br/> <br/>Technically it is very good I think. Aesthetically, the colors are nice. Compositionally though - same comment as others and yourself. Lacks interest - maybe a different angle or something. A 5.1 from me so as not to surprise or disappoint. :)</td>', 'no comment. :P j/k Technically it is very good I think. Aesthetically, the colors are nice. Compositionally though - same comment as others and yourself. Lacks interest - maybe a different angle or something. A 5.1 from me so as not to surprise or disappoint. :)', '2007-10-22 18:08:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4187982, 599666, 67145, '<td valign="top">brilliant photograph michelle... i love those colours and the cobwebs form a great design ... :)</td>', 'brilliant photograph michelle... i love those colours and the cobwebs form a great design ... :)', '2007-10-22 18:08:23.000000', NULL, 0),
