(4187999, 600119, 58452, '<td valign="top">Got to vote on this one, but didn''t get back to comment.  I''d picked this one to win the challenge but had no idea it would score so high.  Congratulations!<br/>The colors are just wonderful.  They pop out of the creamy smooth bokeh like a flash bulb.  The 180 macro is not an easy tool to master.  You have really created a masterpiece.</td>', 'Got to vote on this one, but didn''t get back to comment.  I''d picked this one to win the challenge but had no idea it would score so high.  Congratulations!The colors are just wonderful.  They pop out of the creamy smooth bokeh like a flash bulb.  The 180 macro is not an easy tool to master.  You have really created a masterpiece.', '2007-10-22 18:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4188075, 599340, 28742, '<td valign="top">DUDE!! Congrats on 6th with a most awesome shot! Well done.</td>', 'DUDE!! Congrats on 6th with a most awesome shot! Well done.', '2007-10-22 18:40:35.000000', NULL, 0),
