(4188302, 600103, 81530, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the focus. The composition is very symmetrical, and a different angle might produce a little more variety and interest.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the focus. The composition is very symmetrical, and a different angle might produce a little more variety and interest.', '2007-10-22 20:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4188308, 599356, 59645, '<td valign="top">wow. this is BEAUTIFUL i wish i could have voted for it. 10. i hate how everyone does bugs. i much prefer this and the colors are beautiful!</td>', 'wow. this is BEAUTIFUL i wish i could have voted for it. 10. i hate how everyone does bugs. i much prefer this and the colors are beautiful!', '2007-10-22 20:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4188340, 597542, 29011, '<td valign="top">Cool shot Doc! Congratulations on the ribbon :)<br/> <br/>The color of the mantis is great but I think the background color and contrast compete too much with the scene. A little distracting it is.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-22 19:42:40.</i></td>', 'Cool shot Doc! Congratulations on the ribbon :) The color of the mantis is great but I think the background color and contrast compete too much with the scene. A little distracting it is.', '2007-10-22 20:42:11.000000', '2007-10-22 20:42:40.000000', 0),
