(4188351, 599451, 29011, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! my favorite bug macro from the challenge. The colors and lighting are very soft and eye pleasing. For f2.8 the point of focus is excellent. Great skill you have there.</td>', 'Wonderful! my favorite bug macro from the challenge. The colors and lighting are very soft and eye pleasing. For f2.8 the point of focus is excellent. Great skill you have there.', '2007-10-22 20:47:37.000000', NULL, 0),
