(4188634, 597450, 67145, '<td valign="top">WOW.. another stunning photograph peter .. its a great feeling everytime i open one of your photographs .. the colouring in this is beautiful and the shapes excellent .. i can just see water underneath the leaves .. brilliant .. :)</td>', 'WOW.. another stunning photograph peter .. its a great feeling everytime i open one of your photographs .. the colouring in this is beautiful and the shapes excellent .. i can just see water underneath the leaves .. brilliant .. :)', '2007-10-22 22:52:11.000000', NULL, 0),
