(4190563, 600323, 77196, '<td valign="top">You got robbed - this is a beautiful shot - one of my favorites of the entire challenge (I was one of your 8''s). Of course, this is a close-up of water, with the beautiful reflection of aspen leaves distorted on the surface, and a single leaf to tie it together. Not sure where the other voters expected you to stand to get a "more macro" shot of this...  <br/> <br/>You have some beautiful nature shots - including "Swift Mountain River"<br/></td>', 'You got robbed - this is a beautiful shot - one of my favorites of the entire challenge (I was one of your 8''s). Of course, this is a close-up of water, with the beautiful reflection of aspen leaves distorted on the surface, and a single leaf to tie it together. Not sure where the other voters expected you to stand to get a "more macro" shot of this...   You have some beautiful nature shots - including "Swift Mountain River"', '2007-10-23 22:24:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4190820, 600320, 24454, '<td valign="top">Brian, what a special photo.   I think in another challenge, this would have scored much much better.   You can tell that it is not <i>processed</i> to look old, but is in fact very very old.  Which gives it so much character and meaning.   The composition is really good, but mostly it''s the subject and the special meaning behind the photo that makes it so appealing to me.<br/> <br/>Hold those prayers close to your heart now. . .and you can count on the prayers of your Texas friend to cover you from now on after the things you learned at the doctor today!    Being such a strong Christian, I''m taking comfort in the fact that a book of prayer is so important to you :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Brian, what a special photo.   I think in another challenge, this would have scored much much better.   You can tell that it is not processed to look old, but is in fact very very old.  Which gives it so much character and meaning.   The composition is really good, but mostly it''s the subject and the special meaning behind the photo that makes it so appealing to me. Hold those prayers close to your heart now. . .and you can count on the prayers of your Texas friend to cover you from now on after the things you learned at the doctor today!    Being such a strong Christian, I''m taking comfort in the fact that a book of prayer is so important to you :) ', '2007-10-24 00:00:27.000000', NULL, 0),
