(4191229, 599212, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail on the spider - can''t say I''ve seen one like that before!  Overall I think the thing that may have hurt your score (since I don''t have a problem with the sharpness on the spider, but I like things soft) is the background appears to be grainy/noisy.  It could well be that''s the way background simply IS but to some it may appear as a lot of noise.  (Did you let the spider live??)</td>', 'Very nice detail on the spider - can''t say I''ve seen one like that before!  Overall I think the thing that may have hurt your score (since I don''t have a problem with the sharpness on the spider, but I like things soft) is the background appears to be grainy/noisy.  It could well be that''s the way background simply IS but to some it may appear as a lot of noise.  (Did you let the spider live??)', '2007-10-24 01:48:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191239, 599408, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well done - there''s plenty of detail and texture in the petals - and that''s hard to do with white against dark.  The dark background is perfect for setting apart the bloom.  I like the centered composition for this, too.   (And I just noticed - no 1s,2s, or 3s - that is an accomplishment as well!)</td>', 'Very well done - there''s plenty of detail and texture in the petals - and that''s hard to do with white against dark.  The dark background is perfect for setting apart the bloom.  I like the centered composition for this, too.   (And I just noticed - no 1s,2s, or 3s - that is an accomplishment as well!)', '2007-10-24 01:51:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191434, 597542, 48361, '<td valign="top">You are fantastic.  I have followed your shots for the past year and you are consistently great.<br/></td>', 'You are fantastic.  I have followed your shots for the past year and you are consistently great.', '2007-10-24 03:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191483, 599326, 23002, '<td valign="top">Hey you!<br/> <br/>Congrats on your first challenge!  I know these first two are a bit of a rough start, but we can talk about it when I see you this week. :)<br/> <br/>On this one I will say that a) folks here hate "noise/grain" and b) folks here generally hate things that are not pretty.  <br/> <br/>Personally I like the humour in the shot, but would have worked on getting rid of some of the noise in it, and made it a bit more contrasty.  I will show you how to do all that this week. :)</td>', 'Hey you! Congrats on your first challenge!  I know these first two are a bit of a rough start, but we can talk about it when I see you this week. :) On this one I will say that a) folks here hate "noise/grain" and b) folks here generally hate things that are not pretty.   Personally I like the humour in the shot, but would have worked on getting rid of some of the noise in it, and made it a bit more contrasty.  I will show you how to do all that this week. :)', '2007-10-24 03:49:43.000000', NULL, 0),
