(4202043, 599787, 67145, '<td valign="top">i hadnt seen this one of yours before .. its stunning .. so beautiful the way the flowery things seem to be reaching out .. the colouring is so soft and lovely with the deeper red contrasting .. the little droplets are excellent elements in this macro .. great title .. :)</td>', 'i hadnt seen this one of yours before .. its stunning .. so beautiful the way the flowery things seem to be reaching out .. the colouring is so soft and lovely with the deeper red contrasting .. the little droplets are excellent elements in this macro .. great title .. :)', '2007-10-28 21:13:52.000000', NULL, 0),
