(4205132, 599265, 30982, '<td valign="top">VERY cool.  I never did see any frogs.  Desert rats, rabbits, coyotes, jackals, thousands of bats, but no frogs.  Great close-up - excellent detail, very rich color.  Nice work!</td>', 'VERY cool.  I never did see any frogs.  Desert rats, rabbits, coyotes, jackals, thousands of bats, but no frogs.  Great close-up - excellent detail, very rich color.  Nice work!', '2007-10-30 05:08:33.000000', NULL, 0),
