(4205238, 600352, 67145, '<td valign="top">this of course is just stunning .. the colouring is absolutely fantastic .. the red and the yellow so brilliant .. all the various shapes of the flower compliment each other perfectly .. its the way you''ve taken the photograph that has made it all work so well .. the actual flower in real life would probably be quite unattractive .. lol .. :)</td>', 'this of course is just stunning .. the colouring is absolutely fantastic .. the red and the yellow so brilliant .. all the various shapes of the flower compliment each other perfectly .. its the way you''ve taken the photograph that has made it all work so well .. the actual flower in real life would probably be quite unattractive .. lol .. :)', '2007-10-30 08:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4205816, 599983, 47534, '<td valign="top">i rather like the composition, even if centered, and appreciate what you were going for.  As for the technicals, I''m guessing this is a tight crop from a larger image?  That might explain the graininess, and it somehow ''fits''...</td>', 'i rather like the composition, even if centered, and appreciate what you were going for.  As for the technicals, I''m guessing this is a tight crop from a larger image?  That might explain the graininess, and it somehow ''fits''...', '2007-10-30 13:51:46.000000', NULL, 0),
