(4386907, 600199, 19708, '<td valign="top">No clue what it was other than a Rose.<br/> <br/>Here is the original, straight out of raw conversion:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=631916" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19708/120/631916.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19708/120/631916.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/19708/120/631916.jpg"/></a></td>', 'No clue what it was other than a Rose. Here is the original, straight out of raw conversion:', '2008-01-12 12:33:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4401739, 599841, 33543, '<td valign="top">I have tried to capture this image so many times , but I could never come close to yours, nice , your pic gives me hope. Joseph</td>', 'I have tried to capture this image so many times , but I could never come close to yours, nice , your pic gives me hope. Joseph', '2008-01-17 23:42:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4405092, 599369, 70828, '<td valign="top">Oh roz ... you have such a wonderful portfolio to peruse ... but this is one of your challenge photos that I think was quite underscored ... If this is not worth a 7 ... methinks I will never get a 7+ <br/> <br/>What a superb macro. Colour, focus, leading lines, bokeh, crispness, framing, composition ...</td>', 'Oh roz ... you have such a wonderful portfolio to peruse ... but this is one of your challenge photos that I think was quite underscored ... If this is not worth a 7 ... methinks I will never get a 7+  What a superb macro. Colour, focus, leading lines, bokeh, crispness, framing, composition ...', '2008-01-19 17:26:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4407432, 600318, 70375, '<td valign="top">Heyyyyy I knew your bug photos would start getting better!! Congrats on the 5th place win!! This is a LOVELY image!!</td>', 'Heyyyyy I knew your bug photos would start getting better!! Congrats on the 5th place win!! This is a LOVELY image!!', '2008-01-20 21:14:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4409673, 597432, 73981, '<td valign="top">Love the textures here. I''ve been wanting to do some macro work similar to this. Love the way you processed it. I think this should''ve placed much better.</td>', 'Love the textures here. I''ve been wanting to do some macro work similar to this. Love the way you processed it. I think this should''ve placed much better.', '2008-01-21 09:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4428532, 599962, 20530, '<td valign="top">Wow, super DOF and amazingly sharp! The diagonal line of the whiskers is also very nice.</td>', 'Wow, super DOF and amazingly sharp! The diagonal line of the whiskers is also very nice.', '2008-01-27 11:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4429047, 599962, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''ve handled quite a few of these guys at the shelter and they seem to like me (they do that tooth-grinding purr ... bruxxing I think it''s called?).  I know they''re smart but I just can''t get past those hairless tails, so I''ve never fallen in love with one.  They can make great pets, though, and you got a nice shot of this guy.</td>', 'I''ve handled quite a few of these guys at the shelter and they seem to like me (they do that tooth-grinding purr ... bruxxing I think it''s called?).  I know they''re smart but I just can''t get past those hairless tails, so I''ve never fallen in love with one.  They can make great pets, though, and you got a nice shot of this guy.', '2008-01-27 14:05:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4536673, 598554, 36999, '<td valign="top">great shot in the ''wrong ''challenge...  those voters are stickelers for Macro being REALLY REALLY close!   nice POV!  This would have done so well in a pet portrait challenge or a Point of view challenge.</td>', 'great shot in the ''wrong ''challenge...  those voters are stickelers for Macro being REALLY REALLY close!   nice POV!  This would have done so well in a pet portrait challenge or a Point of view challenge.', '2008-03-03 22:57:15.000000', NULL, 0),
