(4593731, 598839, 53147, '<td valign="top">I do like these type of shots. I dont find the fence to be annoying at all but a strong element to the image. Great capture, great detail and color.</td>', 'I do like these type of shots. I dont find the fence to be annoying at all but a strong element to the image. Great capture, great detail and color.', '2008-03-28 13:16:25.000000', NULL, 0),
