(4622817, 599962, 56880, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a pet rat I had named Blue (it was a "blue" rat).  Such a great pet; it''d eat things out of my hand without biting me even once.  It''s too bad they don''t live very long.  You captured the hair and eyes perfectly, but the background is a little grainy.</td>', 'This reminds me of a pet rat I had named Blue (it was a "blue" rat).  Such a great pet; it''d eat things out of my hand without biting me even once.  It''s too bad they don''t live very long.  You captured the hair and eyes perfectly, but the background is a little grainy.', '2008-04-08 01:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
